msgid ""
"Shades the periods between sunset and sunrise so readings can be read "
"against the solar day rather than the clock. Sun times come from this "
"farm's location."
msgstr "Mengarsir periode antara matahari terbenam dan matahari terbit agar pembacaan dapat dibaca menurut hari matahari, bukan jam. Waktu matahari diambil dari lokasi ini."

